#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopters.rst:10
#: 7f31a7a79e7f400a8e55358666ae9a3d
msgid ""
"Copter supports traditional single rotor, tandem rotor and collective pitch "
"quad rotor helicopters including all the same features as multicopters.  The"
" majority of the set-up is the same as for multicopters but please follow "
"the links at the bottom of the page, or in the sidebar, for helicopter "
"specific information."
msgstr ""
"Copter "
"支持传统单旋翼、纵列双旋翼和集体变距四旋翼直升机，包括与多旋翼飞机相同的所有功能。大多数设置与多旋翼飞机相同，但请通过页面底部或侧边栏的链接获取直升机特定信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopters.rst:17
#: 0a1c62eebe3b4a7d85900e2da60537c9
msgid ""
"Demonstration of a real-world commercial flight with a Trex 600 helicopter "
"flown with the ArduPilot system, including additional add-on RC telemetry "
"and FPV."
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 系统飞行的 Trex 600 直升机在真实商业飞行中的演示，包括额外的附加 RC 数传和 FPV。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopters.rst:24
#: 774bb723dcb74b54a195d1184648c0f3
msgid ""
"Demonstration of a Gaui GX9 pre-flight and being flown with ArduPilot by the"
" Canberra Team in Australia."
msgstr "澳大利亚堪培拉团队使用 ArduPilot 对 Gaui GX9 进行飞行前检查和飞行的演示。"
